lisa-design:
- Overrides are a typed renovate.PackageRule (imagescan.Rule is an alias): the planner builds it and ParseOverrides decodes into it, so its JSON keys are the allowed keys. Docker's image-name grammar lives in renovate.ImageName (imagescan.ParseRef uses it), since imagescan imports renovate and not the other way round.
- Rule 1 fast-tracks only the scanned update: matchUpdateTypes [digest], or [patch] + matchNewValue of the scanned tag with a separate separateMinorPatch rule (Renovate refuses matchUpdateTypes next to pre-lookup options such as allowedVersions).
